    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d404">

                <pb facs="0787" n="771" sameAs="frus:frus1950v02/pg771"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">611.32/10–650</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Memorandum by the Officer in Charge of Brazilian
                        Affairs</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Kidder</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Acting Secretary of
                        State</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                    >Webb</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">confidential</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">[<placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>,] <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1950-10-06">October 6, 1950</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>With reference to numbered paragraph 7, “Status of the Treaty Talks”, in the
                        attachment<anchor n="1" xml:id="d404-f1"/> to the Memorandum for the
                    President, on his appointment with the Brazilian Ambassador (a copy of which is
                    appended hereto), I am submitting to you the attached statement on <pb
                        facs="0788" n="772" xml:id="pg772"/> the four prospective treaties and
                    conventions which we wish to conclude with Brazil.</p>


                <xi:include href="d404-a1.xml" xpointer="d404-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
